message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Feature-Scaling and Stability-Testing Pipeline for Clustering Small Orchard IoT Datasets"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and reproducibility package for the study "A feature-scaling and
  stability-testing pipeline for clustering small orchard IoT datasets". Couples
  hourly IoT orchard-microclimate data with periodic field measurements (leaf C/N
  ratio, flowering, fruit set) and clusters a small, heterogeneous dataset by
  treating feature scaling as an explicit modelling decision and testing cluster
  stability before interpretation.
